forgiveness for your sin. Indeed, you were of the sinful.\"","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"12:30","t":"And women in the city said, \"The wife of al-ʿAzeez is seeking to seduce her slave boy; he has impassioned her with love. Indeed, we see her [to be] in clear error.\"","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":30,"sd":null}],"juz":12,"hizb":24,"surahs":[12],"sajdah":false}